Conclusions
What have you learned?
From this project I have learned how to pass information through a complex function and loop. I’ve also learned that I have the tendency to overcomplicate how I go about engineering problems, and that the solution is actually much easier (and shorter) than I may initially realize.

How difficult was this assignment?
This assignment was difficult. I initially thought I would have to use 3 functions in order to complete it, but after talking with classmates, I realized that I was overcomplicating the assignment, especially since the code that I ended up using and loops made it a lot easier.

How did you overcome challenges?
I had to do a lot of research in order to understand more about the operators and loops for this assignment. I even had to go as far as asking ChatGPT for help debugging my initial code before talking with peers made me realize I was doing too much. However, through my research and ChatGPT’s explanations, even though I didn’t end up doing my original code, I feel as though I understand more about programming.
